Visit the relocation company’s portal and select **“Bangalore to Chennai car relocation.”** Fill in vehicle details (make, model, year, VIN), preferred pickup date, and contact information. A secure payment gateway locks in the rate and generates a booking reference that will appear in every subsequent communication.

**2. Confirmation & Real‑Time Tracking Setup**  
Within minutes, you receive an email/SMS confirming the reservation and a unique tracking ID. The company’s mobile app or web dashboard is activated, allowing you to monitor every stage of the move in real time— from the moment the driver arrives at your doorstep to the final hand‑over in Chennai.

