<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Bangalore to Chennai | Express Carrier Service
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does it cost to transport a car from Bangalore to Chennai with packers and movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical car transport charge from Bangalore to Chennai ranges between INR 8,000 and INR 12,000 for a standard sedan, depending on vehicle size, fuel surcharge, insurance coverage, and any additional services like door‑to‑door pickup. Shree Ashirwad provides a transparent cost matrix that includes all fees upfront, so there are no hidden surprises.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures ensure my vehicle won&#039;t get scratched during the Bangalore‑Chennai move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by three key safety measures: a hydraulically operated low‑profile ramp that eliminates manual handling, fully enclosed multi‑car trailers with padded sidewalls, and real‑time shock‑monitoring sensors that alert our crew to any impact. Together, they protect the paintwork and body panels throughout the 377 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents are mandatory for interstate car transport between Bangalore and Chennai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid RC (Registration Certificate), insurance copy, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed transport agreement, and a GST‑compliant invoice if the move is corporate‑backed. Additionally, an e‑Way Bill is generated for the freight, and a pre‑transit condition report must be signed by both parties.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the car transport take and can I track it in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time on the NH 16 corridor is 7‑9 hours, subject to traffic and weather conditions. Our fleet is equipped with GPS live‑tracking, allowing you to monitor the vehicle’s exact location via a secure portal or mobile app, with automated status updates at each major checkpoint.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges or extra fees I should be aware of for Bangalore to Chennai car relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad follows a strict no‑hidden‑fees policy. The quoted price includes loading, unloading, fuel surcharge, insurance, and GST. Extra fees only arise if you request optional services such as premium insurance, expedited delivery, or special handling for high‑value or vintage cars, and these are disclosed before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport a two‑wheeler or a luxury car using the same service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our specialized two‑wheeler carriers feature wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, while luxury cars are placed in custom wooden crates with additional foam padding. Both vehicle types benefit from the same hydraulic ramp loading and zero‑scratch guarantee, ensuring safe, damage‑free transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the insurance coverage provided by Shree Ashirwad for Bangalore to Chennai vehicle transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for every shipment. This covers accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities throughout the journey. Clients can also opt for higher coverage limits or third‑party policies, and the insurance cost is transparently listed in the final quote.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
